# Spec-Kitti — Discovery Context

If `.spec-kitti/discovery/` exists, **always read these files** before making any architectural decision, code change, or module analysis:

- [architecture.md](mdc:.spec-kitti/discovery/architecture.md) — architectural pattern, layers, infrastructure
- [modules.md](mdc:.spec-kitti/discovery/modules.md) — module responsibilities and key files
- [bounded-contexts.md](mdc:.spec-kitti/discovery/bounded-contexts.md) — business domain boundaries

## Rules
- Never assume the project structure — it is documented above
- When asked "where should this file go?" → answer using `modules.md`
- When asked "is this a layer violation?" → check `architecture.md`
- When a new module is needed → verify it doesn't belong to an existing one first
